  "bio": "Nicolò Barbieri is an esteemed tattoo artist based in Pavia, Italy, renowned for impressive skills in black and gray, realism, and dotwork styles. Holding a residency at Your Round Tattoo Studio, Barbieri's work demonstrates an unmatched level of professionalism, ensuring each client's experience is as immaculate and refined as the tattoos they receive. If you're seeking an artist who can bring intricate designs to life with meticulous precision, Nicolò is the one to see.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Pavia, Lombardy, Italy"
